<title>Netherlands: WEGENER, SABAN COMPLETE TV 10 DEAL.</title>
<headline>WEGENER, SABAN COMPLETE TV 10 DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>APELDOORN, Netherlands 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch publisher Wegener NV said on Thursday it had concluded the transfer of a majority stake in Dutch cable channel TV 10 to Saban Entertainment Inc of Los Angeles.</p>
<p>Wegener said on January 2 its Arcade unit was in talks with Saban and expected to reach agreement on a joint venture.</p>
<p>&quot;These negotiations were recently concluded successfully, with an agreement under which Saban holds a majority position of TV 10 BV, the company that manages the station,&quot; Wegener said in a statement.</p>
<p>No financial details were disclosed. Arcade's rock music channel, The Music Factory, is not included in the deal. -- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
